{"id": "fy1-limit-of-sum", "field": "sequences-limits", "tier": "medium", "language": "en", "trivial": false, "request": "Suppose a_n → a and b_n → b as n → ∞. Prove from the ε-N definition that a_n + b_n → a + b.", "expected_conclusion": "a_n→a かつ b_n→b ならば a_n+b_n → a+b。認める定理文: ε-N 形、または Filter.Tendsto による形のどちらでもよい（証明方法の指定は定理文に反映しない）。", "fast_outcome": "fallthrough", "fast_reason": "explanation_rejected", "kind": "prove", "answer": null, "tactic": "model_0", "formal": "∀ (a b : ℝ) (aSeq bSeq : ℕ → ℝ), Filter.Tendsto aSeq Filter.atTop (nhds a) → Filter.Tendsto bSeq Filter.atTop (nhds b) → Filter.Tendsto (fun n => aSeq n + bSeq n) Filter.atTop (nhds (a + b))", "proved": "∀ (a b : ℝ) (aSeq bSeq : ℕ → ℝ), Filter.Tendsto aSeq Filter.atTop (nhds a) → Filter.Tendsto bSeq Filter.atTop (nhds b) → Filter.Tendsto (fun n => aSeq n + bSeq n) Filter.atTop (nhds (a + b))", "explanation": "Let $(a_n)$ and $(b_n)$ be real sequences converging to $a$ and $b$, respectively. The key idea is to use the fact that limits of real sequences are preserved under addition.\n\nThe hypotheses say that $a_n \\to a$ and $b_n \\to b$. The theorem `Filter.Tendsto.add` applies to these two convergences and states that adding convergent real sequences gives a sequence converging to the sum of their limits.\n\nApplying it with the given sequences yields $a_n+b_n \\to a+b$. This establishes the requested limit; the verified proof uses the general theorem for limits rather than deriving the result directly from the $\\varepsilon$-$N$ definition.\n\nTherefore, $a_n+b_n$ converges to $a+b$.", "explanation_approved": false, "explanation_issue": "rejected:The task explicitly asks for a proof from the ε-N definition, but the explanation says it uses a general limit theorem instead. It also states the complete convergence claim in the last section and re", "gate": {"passed": true, "reasons": []}, "fast_seconds": {"first_call": 3.079, "closed": 3.71, "verified": 4.914, "gate": 5.611, "explained": 7.46, "explanation_review": 5.425, "reviewed": 12.885, "total": 12.885}, "winner": "fallback", "total_s": 80.46, "fast_usd": 0.0, "normal": {"ok": true, "repairs": 1, "wall_s": 67.673, "answer_s": 80.4565611750586, "usd": 0.0272}, "calls": [{"label": "merged", "model": "gpt-6-luna", "effort": "none", "prompt_chars": 1397, "input_tokens": 452, "output_tokens": 126, "start": 0.001, "end": 3.079, "seconds": 3.078, "error": null}, {"label": "merged", "model": "gpt-6-luna", "effort": "none", "prompt_chars": 1397, "input_tokens": 452, "output_tokens": 155, "start": 0.0, "end": 3.148, "seconds": 3.147, "error": null}, {"label": "merged", "model": "gpt-6-luna", "effort": "none", "prompt_chars": 1397, "input_tokens": 452, "output_tokens": 126, "start": 0.001, "end": 3.245, "seconds": 3.244, "error": null}, {"label": "review_terse", "model": "gpt-6-luna", "effort": "none", "prompt_chars": 1091, "input_tokens": 324, "output_tokens": 22, "start": 3.08, "end": 5.27, "seconds": 2.19, "error": null}, {"label": "review_terse", "model": "gpt-6-luna", "effort": "none", "prompt_chars": 1031, "input_tokens": 312, "output_tokens": 22, "start": 3.079, "end": 5.611, "seconds": 2.532, "error": null}, {"label": "explain", "model": "gpt-6-luna", "effort": "none", "prompt_chars": 1451, "input_tokens": 420, "output_tokens": 186, "start": 3.711, "end": 7.46, "seconds": 3.749, "error": null}]}
{"id": "fy1-reverse-triangle-inequality", "field": "inequalities", "tier": "easy", "language": "ja", "trivial": false, "request": "実数 a,b について、||a|−|b|| ≤ |a−b| が成り立つことを示せ。", "expected_conclusion": "任意の実数 a,b について ||a|−|b|| ≤ |a−b|。", "fast_outcome": "fallthrough", "fast_reason": "fidelity_gate_failed", "kind": "prove", "answer": null, "tactic": "grind", "formal": "∀ a b : ℝ, abs (abs a - abs b) ≤ abs (a - b)", "proved": "∀ a b : ℝ, abs (abs a - abs b) ≤ abs (a - b)", "explanation": "実数 $a,b$ に対し、絶対値の差を $|a-b|$ で評価するには、絶対値の基本的な三角不等式を用います。\n\n三角不等式より、$|a|=|(a-b)+b|\\\\le |a-b|+|b|$ です。両辺から $|b|$ を引くと、$|a|-|b|\\\\le |a-b|$ となります。同様に、$|b|=|(b-a)+a|\\\\le |b-a|+|a|=|a-b|+|a|$ なので、$|b|-|a|\\\\le |a-b|$ です。\n\nここで、$x=|a|-|b|$ とおくと、得られた二つの不等式は $x\\\\le |a-b|$ および $-x\\\\le |a-b|$ を意味します。したがって $|x|\\\\le |a-b|$ であり、$x$ の定義を戻せば所望の評価が得られます。\n\nよって、すべての実数 $a,b$ について $\\bigl||a|-|b|\\bigr|\\le |a-b|$ が成り立ちます。", "explanation_approved": null, "explanation_issue": "", "gate": {"passed": false, "reasons": ["formalisations_disagree"]}, "fast_seconds": {"first_call": 3.088, "closed": 5.931, "verified": 7.429, "gate": 7.281, "explained": 10.657, "total": 10.657}, "winner": "fallback", "total_s": 97.576, "fast_usd": 0.0, "normal": {"ok": true, "repairs": 2, "wall_s": 84.409, "answer_s": 97.5534550800221, "usd": 0.0376}, "calls": [{"label": "merged", "model": "gpt-6-luna", "effort": "none", "prompt_chars": 1347, "input_tokens": 447, "output_tokens": 67, "start": 0.001, "end": 3.088, "seconds": 3.087, "error": null}, {"label": "merged", "model": "gpt-6-luna", "effort": "none", "prompt_chars": 1347, "input_tokens": 447, "output_tokens": 171, "start": 0.0, "end": 3.664, "seconds": 3.663, "error": null}, {"label": "merged", "model": "gpt-6-luna", "effort": "none", "prompt_chars": 1347, "input_tokens": 447, "output_tokens": 249, "start": 0.002, "end": 4.28, "seconds": 4.278, "error": null}, {"label": "review_terse", "model": "gpt-6-luna", "effort": "none", "prompt_chars": 883, "input_tokens"