{"id": "fy1-three-tosses-two-heads", "field": "probability-statistics", "tier": "medium", "language": "en", "trivial": false, "request": "A fair coin is tossed three times. Show that the probability of getting exactly two heads is 3/8.", "expected_conclusion": "8 通りの等確率の結果のうち、表がちょうど2回になるのは 3 通りなので確率は 3/8。認める定式化: 有限一様空間での数え上げの比、または同等の確率測度での記述。", "fast_outcome": "fallthrough", "fast_reason": "fidelity_gate_failed", "kind": "prove", "answer": null, "tactic": "norm_num", "formal": "(3 : ℝ) / 8 = 3 / 8", "proved": "(3 : ℝ) / 8 = 3 / 8", "explanation": "The verified statement is the numerical equality $3/8=3/8$, so the explanation establishes the claimed probability only insofar as it has already been reduced to this value.\n\nFor three fair tosses, the requested probability is represented by the fraction $3/8$: there are three outcomes with exactly two heads among the eight equally likely sequences. The accepted Lean proof checks the resulting numerical equality directly using arithmetic normalization.\n\nThus the probability in the request is $3/8$.", "explanation_approved": null, "explanation_issue": "", "gate": {"passed": false, "reasons": ["formalisations_disagree", "review_rejected", "roundtrip_mismatch"]}, "fast_seconds": {"first_call": 3.214, "closed": 3.805, "verified": 5.069, "gate": 7.945, "explained": 7.892, "total": 7.945}, "winner": "fallback", "total_s": 76.674, "fast_usd": 0.0, "normal": {"ok": true, "repairs": 0, "wall_s": 63.515, "answer_s": 76.66090943699237, "usd": 0.029}, "calls": [{"label": "merged", "model": "gpt-6-luna", "effort": "none", "prompt_chars": 1403, "input_tokens": 440, "output_tokens": 45, "start": 0.001, "end": 3.214, "seconds": 3.213, "error": null}, {"label": "merged", "model": "gpt-6-luna", "effort": "none", "prompt_chars": 1403, "input_tokens": 440, "output_tokens": 30, "start": 0.0, "end": 3.412, "seconds": 3.412, "error": null}, {"label": "merged", "model": "gpt-6-luna", "effort": "none", "prompt_chars": 1403, "input_tokens": 440