{"id": "fy1-union-monotone", "field": "discrete-logic", "tier": "easy", "language": "ja", "trivial": true, "request": "集合 A,B,C について、A⊆B ならば A∪C ⊆ B∪C であることを示せ。", "expected_conclusion": "A⊆B ならば A∪C ⊆ B∪C。", "fast_outcome": "fallthrough", "fast_reason": "fidelity_gate_failed", "kind": "prove", "answer": null, "tactic": "model_0", "formal": "∀ (α : Type*) (A B C : Set α), A ⊆ B → A ∪ C ⊆ B ∪ C", "proved": "∀ (α : Type*) (A B C : Set α), A ⊆ B → A ∪ C ⊆ B ∪ C", "explanation": "型の集合 $A,B,C$ を取り、$A\\subseteq B$ と仮定します。和集合への所属を要素ごとに調べます。\n\n任意に $x\\in A\\cup C$ を取ると、和集合の定義より $x\\in A$ または $x\\in C$ です。\n\n前者なら、仮定 $A\\subseteq B$ から $x\\in B$ となるので、$x\\in B\\cup C$ です。後者なら、$x\\in C$ であることから、そのまま $x\\in B\\cup C$ です。したがって、どちらの場合も $x\\in B\\cup C$ となります。\n\nよって、$A\\cup C\\subseteq B\\cup C$ です。", "explanation_approved": null, "explanation_issue": "", "gate": {"passed": false, "reasons": ["formalisations_disagree", "roundtrip_mismatch"]}, "fast_seconds": {"first_call": 3.407, "closed": 3.988, "verified": 5.303, "gate": 6.151, "explained": 7.52, "total": 7.52}, "winner": "fallback", "total_s": 32.138, "fast_usd": 0.0, "normal": {"ok": true, "repairs": 0, "wall_s": 22.23, "answer_s": 32.117872142000124, "usd": 0.011}, "calls": [{"label": "merged", "model": "gpt-6-luna", "effort": "none", "prompt_chars": 1347, "input_tokens": 450, "output_tokens": 126, "start": 0.0, "end": 3.407, "seconds": 3.407, "error": null}, {"label": "merged", "model": "gpt-6-luna", "effort": "none", "prompt_chars": 1347, "input_tokens": 450, "output_tokens": 149, "start": 0.001, "end": 3.477, "seconds": 3.476, "error": null}, {"label": "merged", "model": "gpt-6-luna", "effort": "none", "prompt_chars": 1347, "input_tokens": 450, "output_tokens": 151, "start": 0.001, "end": 3.933, "seconds": 3.933, "error": null}, {"label": "review_terse", "model": "gpt-6-luna", "effort": "none", "prompt_chars": 843, "input_tokens": 265, "output_tokens": 22, "start": 3.408, "end": 5.445, "seconds": 2.037, "error": null}, {